ips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">玻璃鸟儿，不会唱歌。不耐高温，轻拿轻放。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×4</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/3\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\"><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/100px-CurrencyItem-203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/150px-CurrencyItem-203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/200px-CurrencyItem-203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\">利齿子儿</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学家的货币。各方各面都有所需。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×800</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "分别善恶之果"}}